{"version":1,"key":"card:542","content":{"id":542,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记笔记常遇到的两个误区："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"形式大于内容"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常常纠结于格式，排版，字数，是否存在遗漏（比如整本书的知识点是否有遗漏），真正关心的应当是有用的信息，能不能为未来的自己所用，未来的自己会怎么用，形式是为内容服务的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只记录，不思考"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们觉得某段话打动我们，于是我们想记录，但是这种感觉是模糊，如果当时没有想清楚为什么需要记录，等到事后我们翻阅时一定一头雾水，因为这是没有预思考后的信息，我们要想办法把这种模糊的想法清晰化，有一个办法就是提问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个笔记对未来的我有什么用？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我是否经历过或看到过类似的事情？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个观点的过人之处在于哪里？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个理论适合在什么样的场景下用？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"..."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总而言之，不要做知识的搬运工"}]}]}]}],"tags":["学习方法","读书/笔记的方法"],"createTime":1743579244213,"updateTime":1743606003886,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743606003886}}